[
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_1",
    "source": "This is the fate I choose.",
    "target": "这就是我选择的命运。",
    "source_sha256": "7c3025d57b87b5a6c4326ca6176b56d70c9240159b7a89031f7f8a213ba7a6b3",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 268
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_2",
    "source": "No others were qualified to sit the throne of Denmark. It is time to let someone competent rule.",
    "target": "没有其他人有资格坐上丹麦的王位。是时候让有能力的人来统治了。",
    "source_sha256": "f2c1d256d807d0962d3f0b6d8ce1fc5f025d73b88701f6c83762f4f45206f545",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 270
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_3",
    "source": "Who better than the woman who has seen all possible fates? Who else can have the power I hold?",
    "target": "谁能比见过所有可能命运的女人更合适？还有谁能拥有我掌握的力量？",
    "source_sha256": "3e0ded77203ec54d7104660f3a4deb012bcb56711bc648764b77efc5c5930d88",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 271
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_4",
    "source": "I was once Cassandra, cursed to warn people and have them reject me.",
    "target": "我曾是卡珊德拉，身负诅咒：向人们发出警告，却始终无人肯信。",
    "source_sha256": "3704d0e458b0fb3b80610ceba3bfadafee805d05de3c5f13f13c9598195220e3",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 272
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_5",
    "source": "Now I am Tyche, the goddess who makes her own destiny.",
    "target": "如今我是堤喀，创造自身命运的女神。",
    "source_sha256": "fa034464c49b23fb95186da70f18826e063e05b242044775d5bf76a51b55572a",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 273
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_6",
    "source": "Fortinbras meets me in Elsinore's throne room, and for the first time we are able to speak as peers.",
    "target": "福丁布拉斯在埃尔西诺的王座厅与我会面，我们第一次能够以平等的身份交谈。",
    "source_sha256": "683b8307ccc569a4edc5c7640b3e8240c4496bc2486cfa9eb1664e512d996665",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 276
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_7",
    "source": "He agrees the war is senseless, so I cede him his little swamp, and we end it.",
    "target": "他也认为这场战争毫无意义，于是我把那一小片沼泽割让给他，就此结束了战争。",
    "source_sha256": "032e59bc68be808ab5295738305148c9eb28193c74bb3cf865926944121e9849",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 277
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_8",
    "source": "Let him have it. Let him have it all. Men's pride will always be the end of them.",
    "target": "给他就是了。全给他就是了。男人的自傲总会让他们走向灭亡。",
    "source_sha256": "5d034a7209eee9c379fbde42503808f58fa3034e4cc1e241a05fedf3b5b53595",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 278
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_9",
    "source": "Denmark is smaller now, certainly, but all the richer—as Norway turns its focus to Sweden and the two tear each other apart.",
    "target": "如今丹麦的疆域确实小了，却也更加富足——挪威转而盯上了瑞典，两国斗得两败俱伤。",
    "source_sha256": "1ba0fb9c09b8c081e06c04fab8005dae6ce499a3995e5c7a884192f5d856fd98",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 279
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_10",
    "source": "And all I had to do to avert that fate was listen.",
    "target": "而要避开那种命运，我所需要做的，不过是倾听。",
    "source_sha256": "7393c58ff1c723e692fe92329a93f4d3741131189225bf5804f393a96bb0121e",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 280
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_10_5",
    "source": "The nobility are angry about taxation, about the flow of capital and power away from them. So I invite them to meet with me and I hear their grievances.",
    "target": "贵族们对税收不满，对财富和权力从他们手中流失感到愤怒。于是我邀请他们来与我会面，听取他们的怨言。",
    "source_sha256": "020dfbd6fbd91831e68fc249d7cc96f532b0dd7a109205726dc6a63cad3053f6",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 281
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_11",
    "source": "At first, they think me unfit to rule. They argue over who ought to be King among them.",
    "target": "起初，他们觉得我不配统治。他们争论着该由他们之中的谁来当国王。",
    "source_sha256": "22361cf43d7a0eb4ee43a54a9a3b3ed4d01efdf53fc4c7195ce1d2c19500a946",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 282
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_12",
    "source": "But averting war with Norway is a point in my favor. Unproven though I might be, I am a Queen.",
    "target": "但避免了与挪威的战争，让我多了几分优势。即使我的能力尚未得到证明，我也是女王。",
    "source_sha256": "d759853b555a0fad70f3b273a5203fc57e3315d65aa933334913ff8403509d24",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 283
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_13",
    "source": "These days I am free of anger, free of ego or envy. I feel nothing at all.",
    "target": "如今，我没有愤怒，没有自负，也没有嫉妒。我什么都感觉不到。",
    "source_sha256": "a1600c0a8b87222cbd9bf9545e2e4cbe6a1e46356610645fa0eddba812b976e3",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 284
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_14",
    "source": "I have nothing to lose. I have lost it all a hundred times before. And in that, the nobles find respect for me.",
    "target": "我已经没什么可失去的了。一切，我早已失去过上百次。也正因如此，贵族们对我生出了敬意。",
    "source_sha256": "ce5b670d771b232df89f84ab67434334d022e68b422f4955277e3678a7f346f9",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 285
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_15",
    "source": "Claudius had moved to centralize power within the Danish crown and away from nobility.",
    "target": "克劳狄斯曾着手将权力从贵族手中收回，集中到丹麦王室。",
    "source_sha256": "8e045464cb58b717434d430e417f03a2b643abc1546c5880b65738f03666c86b",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 286
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_16",
    "source": "But now, I establish a system of checks and balances to ensure all parties have equivalent say.",
    "target": "但如今，我建立了一套相互制衡的制度，确保各方都有同等的话语权。",
    "source_sha256": "ee1715c15ff1fa76dcbaf26773c7ed04aa7bc9c664a957cdd0a571a00943e36f",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 287
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_17",
    "source": "No king should have the power to sway a kingdom and begin a war as he pleases. I've already seen the kind of bloodshed which lies down that route.",
    "target": "任何国王都不该拥有随心所欲地左右国家、发动战争的权力。我已经见过走上那条路会带来怎样的流血。",
    "source_sha256": "b8b476ef63d7d1f76cc939a64684140cf03255d6bfb5aed257d690c8f91b616f",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 288
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_18",
    "source": "Having earned their great respect, the nobility endeavor to work with me as much as possible.",
    "target": "我赢得了贵族们极大的尊重，他们也尽可能努力与我合作。",
    "source_sha256": "688725fd402b10b05d4ba074a1dd3fff21bafc17ba8ebbe0e425d6e65b02d02f",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 289
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_19",
    "source": "We are able to enact incredible change. Things I never imagined possible when Claudius ruled alone.",
    "target": "我们得以推行惊人的变革。在克劳狄斯独自统治时，我从未想过这些事能成为现实。",
    "source_sha256": "19b3e282ec43c7abe833550fb9b52c5212a44010fbd98a0e8057e0789623d40f",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 290
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_20",
    "source": "Now and then, I hear rumors and insults. People think me cold. They whisper of the deaths which plagued our court, the deaths which made me queen.",
    "target": "偶尔，我会听见流言和辱骂。人们觉得我冷漠。他们低声议论着宫廷里接连发生的死亡，那些让我成为女王的死亡。",
    "source_sha256": "558d70dabe55a7665d857c66a6e3d8dd0ad31a4788e8c5347a0006eb411db5dd",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 291
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_21",
    "source": "They believe I ought to grieve more than I do. They wonder if a woman of my standing should ever have been made queen.",
    "target": "他们认为我应该表现得更悲痛。他们怀疑，像我这种身份的女人，究竟该不该被立为女王。",
    "source_sha256": "af6ba20fa3caf9fa02a574523a2600ff12c73891dc75ffe51e08a7e5fb1a947a",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 292
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_22",
    "source": "They wonder what happened to Ophelia, the girl—not Ophelia, the queen.",
    "target": "他们想知道，奥菲莉娅究竟怎么了——他们问的是那个姑娘，而非这位女王。",
    "source_sha256": "7bf687926024186d04f71c683e90d8ffb0fb08dbe02b2c46a51c2a238dcbc345",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 293
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_23",
    "source": "I know what became of the girl. Her future was stolen from her. She was forced to endure hell. And she came through it, alive but only half human.",
    "target": "我知道那个姑娘变成了什么样。她的未来被夺走了。她被迫承受地狱般的折磨。她熬了过来，还活着，却已不再是一个完整的人。",
    "source_sha256": "f61a57b9645a562800e9d6974d105a1f9eb6aed7ea6ce7b5d2896d129c904c37",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 294
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_24",
    "source": "Over time, those whom I called friends pull away from me. They cannot relate to the world I live in now, and I don't ask them to.",
    "target": "渐渐地，那些我曾称为朋友的人疏远了我。他们无法理解我如今所处的世界，我也不要求他们理解。",
    "source_sha256": "e9a270482dc834703a709a59af55a5d6376fd44ba7b26ea365ca002ef32c3ec9",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 296
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_25",
    "source": "I must do what is best for my country. Even if that means leaving my old life behind. Even if that means I weather this alone.",
    "target": "我必须做对国家最有利的事。哪怕这意味着抛下过去的生活。哪怕这意味着独自承受这一切。",
    "source_sha256": "8b843991bc33f5a28ed8d650d1e0b85c96194de6e563309f36378230743c1a5b",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 297
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_26",
    "source": "Out behind the castle, a tiny row of new white graves line the small hillock to the north.",
    "target": "城堡后方，北面的小山丘上排列着短短一排新立的白色坟墓。",
    "source_sha256": "ac887d217b502522dac00b55fb55623ddae7eed6e906e0606df0c87e5629f3bf",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 298
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_27",
    "source": "As the years pass, they, too, grow mossy and sink into the earth, joining the others. And memories of those who are buried beneath them fade into obscurity.",
    "target": "岁月流逝，它们也长满青苔，沉入泥土，与其他坟墓一样。而那些埋葬在下面的人，也渐渐淡出人们的记忆，湮没无闻。",
    "source_sha256": "dffffa883c5edaa533bbcbed7ec7d8271a8c6012236b60731be94b43c5f2d109",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 299
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_28",
    "source": "I do not go to visit them. I do not want to remember.",
    "target": "我不去探望他们。我不想回忆。",
    "source_sha256": "bca7906afa35e9855869e8ce6e73c4e270c72c2ea9b3f3524a5219b1bd27a1ae",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 300
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_29",
    "source": "I do not want to run into those who remain. I do not want their faces to linger.",
    "target": "我不想碰见那些还在的人。我不想让他们的面容在脑海中挥之不去。",
    "source_sha256": "60350ddeb4ca1d0c931401242076208bea4d0e1fb6bea53c5843c53758d20507",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
        "asset_sha256": "208f35f21b8b5fe423259aea6e9683d7dbfdb183b2a4b0ff0bb1d63c3c8df4c7",
        "scene": "ENDING_Queen",
        "line": 301
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "queen-ending-Ending_Queen_30",
    "source": "Living and dead comingle into a tiny box which I bury somewhere deep in my heart: The box of the Elsinore that was.",
    "target": "生者与死者一同收进一个小小的盒子，被我埋在心底某个深处：那是装着昔日埃尔西诺的盒子。",
    "source_sha256": "6cc044836f417cc7bdf2f66880623fdff662e1cedeb48668fe39e0169e2ceb8e",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes_endings",
